    "$t": "無應該ê歇睏日（有聲♪）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PQIqhhRCaso?list=PLXGFtP8Nq2rPRttUxu-6cAsoUJjZAB6BQ\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n台文通訊BONG報十月號（No.271）</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n-----------------------------------------------<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">▍無應該</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> ê </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">歇睏日</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">作者：亞茱</span></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">歇睏日</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">是叫人寫兩倍宿題</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">的日子</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">？</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Guán</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">感覺</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">無應該</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">neh</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">睏醒</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ah</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">神神</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ā</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">倒</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--leh</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">M̄</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">免趕緊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">beh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">起床</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Ē-tàng</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">好好仔想一下</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">tú-tsiah</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">做</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">夢</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Phâng</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">一杯牛奶、一粒煎卵包</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Tī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">埕</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">裡</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">閒閒仔食，閒閒仔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">lim</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Koh ē-tàng</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">聽著白粉鳥</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">kuh-kuh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">唱歌</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">去學校</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">時，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">tshiâng-tsāi</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">經過</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">小路</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">M̄-bat</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">名</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">野花野草</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">teh ia̍t</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">手</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">koh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">有飛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">、跳</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">、行</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">、爬</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--ê </span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">真濟古錐</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">小動物</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">若無歇睏日</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Beh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">按怎有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">thang</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">去揣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--in</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">？</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">歇睏日</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">是叫人寫兩倍宿題</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">日子</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">--m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">？</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Guán tī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">心內</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">一直搖頭、搖頭</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n"
